================================================================================
Optional neural optical flow (fetched by scripts, never committed)
================================================================================
Used only when the "Neural" flow backend is available; every build works
without them, and nothing below is stored in this repository.  They are
downloaded or rebuilt into gitignored folders by scripts/fetch_onnxruntime.ps1
and scripts/fetch_flow_model.py.  A binary distribution that SHIPS them must
include their licence texts.

* ONNX Runtime                      MIT                https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.
* SEA-RAFT optical flow model       BSD-3-Clause       https://github.com/princeton-vl/SEA-RAFT
  Copyright (c) 2024, Princeton Vision & Learning Lab.
  models/searaft_s_gray.onnx is an ONNX export of the authors' published
  "Tartan-C-T-TSKH432x960-S" weights, with a grayscale input adapter and
  input scaling folded into the graph; the network itself is unmodified.
* NVIDIA cuDNN                      NVIDIA cuDNN SLA   https://developer.nvidia.com/cudnn
  Loaded at runtime by ONNX Runtime's CUDA provider; not redistributed here.

Research papers, standards and datasets the project used or evaluated are
listed in docs/CITATIONS.md.
